  "notes": [
    "**Cortar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **cortado** (regular)",
    "Multiple meanings: to cut, to chop, to slice, to trim",
    "Common usage: *cortar el pan* (to cut the bread), *cortar el pelo* (to cut hair), *cortar la conversación* (to cut off the conversation)",
    "Related noun: **el corte** (cut)",
    "Expression: *cortar por lo sano* (to nip it in the bud - literally \"to cut through the healthy part\")"
